JOHN SOLOMON: What you see inside American mosques right now is a group of people that are saying things like “America is the great Satan” and that it’s time for “great retribution” against the Zionists, i.e., Jews and people who support them in the Israel state.

This level of extremism isn’t normally visible to the American people, but that is who El-Sayed is asking for their vote. That is who is on our soil right now.

